      "role": "user",
      "content": "The concept of depth over breadth is noted. My primary concern remains the scrutiny of the current occupants of the Aragonese spheres of influence. They have grown complacent, but their surveillance networks are sophisticated. If I were to begin moving capital into decentralized holdings to fund my eventual restoration, what specific methods would you recommend to ensure these movements are flagged neither by state actors nor by the private intelligence firms currently serving the pretenders?",
